        "description": "Polymorfa team key (pmfa_ prefix), project token (pmfa_pt_ prefix) where supported, or short-lived client token (pmfa_ct_ prefix). Team keys and project tokens may be personal or service-account owned and enforce selected action scopes. Team keys cover the team and its projects; project tokens stay inside one project. Client tokens stay inside their live project and connection and enforce their client rules and immutable mint-time action ceiling. Treat all credentials as opaque strings. Never parse them or assume a fixed length; store at least 512 characters. Server keys use issuance-record lookup; short-lived client tokens carry a signed permission ceiling."
